=== BANG SO SANH CONG BANG (CUNG NGAN SACH KIEM THU) ===

+-----------------------------+-----------------+-----------------+------------------------+-------------------+
| Chien luoc Fuzzing          | Ngan sach (lan) | So crash tim ra | Lan thu dau tien crash | Hieu qua tong the |
+-----------------------------+-----------------+-----------------+------------------------+-------------------+
| Hop den (Black-box)         | 500 lan         | 0 crash         | Khong tim thay         | 0% (that bai)     |
| Hop den (Black-box)         | 1000 lan        | 0 crash         | Khong tim thay         | 0% (that bai)     |
| Hop trang (Coverage-guided) | 500 lan         | 3 crash         | Lan thu 402            | 100% (thanh cong) |
+-----------------------------+-----------------+-----------------+------------------------+-------------------+

KET LUAN SO SANH:
- Du chi duoc cap mot nua ngan sach (500 lan so voi 1000 lan), fuzzer hop trang da tim duoc 3 crash khac nhau,
  trong khi fuzzer hop den hoan toan bat luc.
- Su khac biet den tu vong lap phan hoi (Coverage Feedback Loop):
  + Hop den bo phi hang nghin phep thu vao cac vung khong gian khong loi vi khong biet minh dang o dau.
  + Hop trang biet chinh xac khi nao minh tien gan toi vung loi de tap trung nguon luc dot bien sau vao do.